
# Clinic Appointment System
## Interface Design Patterns

### 1. Card Pattern

The Card Pattern organizes patient information and appointment details into separate sections. This makes the form easier to read and helps users find the information they need.

### 2. Form-Based Workflow

The form-based workflow guides patients in entering their personal information and appointment details before submitting their appointment request. This makes the booking process simple and organized.

## Target Users

The application is designed for patients who want to schedule a clinic appointment online without visiting the clinic just to request a schedule.

## Purpose

These design patterns improve the organization, readability, and usability of the Clinic Appointment System.
